&lt;h2&gt;🏊 Der MQTT-fähige Smart Swimmingpool Controller 🎛️&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="-der-mqtt-fähige-smart-swimmingpool-controller-"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
